(/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#1982---fixedimproved-base-advciv-ai-non-combat-food-production-allocation-could-stall-small-growing-cities-instead-of-using-mature-or-stagnant-foodproduction-pumps-observed-with-workers).
